  "loc": "Abstract; Section 2 (Background), p. 9565",
  "quote": "VAAs provide voters with personalized recommendations on which parties or candidates",
  "note": "The paper studies voting advice applications, which are recommender systems. Each voter gets a personal ranking of candidates by distance between answer vectors. No collective decision is made by aggregating several agents' inputs, so this is not a voting procedure. Coding stopped."
